{"copyright":{"thirdPartyPermissionsProduced":false,"disclosedToPublic":false,"containsIndication":false,"publisherPermissionOrRightsToDistribute":false,"belongsToUsGov":false,"determinationType":"PUBLIC_USE_PERMITTED","thirdPartyContentCondition":"NOT_SET","belongsToContractor":false,"disclosedInvention":false,"licenseType":"NO","submissionId":20220013669,"containsThirdPartyMaterial":false,"belongsToPublisher":false,"id":"1523b639c627409fa0594a2698672ddf","belongsToAuthors":false},"subjectCategories":["Man/System Technology And Life Support"],"exportControl":{"isExportControl":"NO","submissionId":20220013669,"ear":"NO","id":"998c8af62e2d44b6bbcb235a642d5a66","itar":"NO"},"distributionDate":"2022-10-27T04:00:00.0000000+00:00","fundingNumbers":[{"number":"80MSFC19R0024","submissionId":20220013669,"id":"5cabb08e7acb46b3a0083ed71c5804a6","type":"CONTRACT_GRANT"}],"title":"Internal Layout of a Lunar Surface Habitat","stiType":"CONFERENCE_PAPER","distribution":"PUBLIC","submittedDate":"2022-09-06T19:42:59.4321110+00:00","authorAffiliations":[{"sequence":0,"submissionId":20220013669,"meta":{"author":{"name":"Callie Burke"},"organization":{"name":"Binera, Inc.","location":"77 S. Washington St., Rockville, MD 20850"}},"id":"836f1c40e100404d87251b7648113130","userId":"3b5fef8e8ced46f1928e0d5ae94b575a"},{"organizationId":"4c6a2b878d76521da887cdcb2564bf90","sequence":1,"submissionId":20220013669,"meta":{"author":{"orcidId":"","name":"Robert L. Howard, Jr"},"organization":{"name":"Johnson Space Center","location":"Houston, Texas, United States"}},"id":"8bdbdcf73d07449bb0de5bf07de17020","userType":"CIVIL","userId":"e1df2a3e7bb24506970ac3cfe96a18f3"},{"organizationId":"68603dff261e5d2d9de5a550aa9e6b30","sequence":2,"submissionId":20220013669,"meta":{"author":{"orcidId":"","name":"Paul Kessler"},"organization":{"name":"Langley Research Center","location":"Hampton, Virginia, United States"}},"id":"4776c50d6f274855a1d7d7c9050442cb","userType":"CIVIL","userId":"e33342e0d64a49eb98cfd44754fb2de4"}],"stiTypeDetails":"Conference Paper","technicalReviewType":"SINGLE_EXPERT","modified":"2025-08-31T18:39:21.7150190+00:00","id":20220013669,"created":"2022-09-06T19:39:01.3916700+00:00","center":{"code":"MSFC","name":"Marshall Space Flight Center","id":"a589fc1e68af409f9d2214bb08863d11"},"onlyAbstract":false,"sensitiveInformation":2,"abstract":"NASA is currently developing concepts for sustained crewed missions to the lunar surface. Sustained missions will occur on annual basis for durations of 30 days or more. To house and support the crew, NASA is exploring the use of a lunar Surface Habitat. NASA relies on conceptual spacecraft design to assist in planning and mission analysis. A crucial component of this habitation design is the internal layout: the interior location of systems, workstations, crew quarters, etc.  The purpose of this paper is to describe the process and resulting layout of a specific Surface Habitat design. This paper describes the SH’s hybrid inflatable structure then details the habitat’s interior layout. The proposed SH’s internal layout is depicted inside a hybrid inflatable structure using a low-fidelity CAD model. Multiple NASA references were consulted to determine the SH’s required functionality, minimal Net Habitable Volume, and minimal functional dimensions. These functions and volumes contribute to the placement and location of systems and spaces inside the habitat. In addition to functional volume, the layout includes systems and logistics placement. The resulting design will aid NASA in mission planning and further systems analysis.","isLessonsLearned":false,"disseminated":"DOCUMENT_AND_METADATA","cui":{"isCui":false,"submissionId":20220013669,"id":"f9be8b114edd4b209cdf6a3f5d107a2f"},"meetings":[{"country":"US","submissionId":20220013669,"endDate":"2022-10-26T05:00:00.0000000+00:00","sponsors":[{"organizationId":"71fb4af96d4a59b5a0a2084db7b4ce35","meta":{"organization":{"name":"American Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics","location":"Reston, Virginia, United States"}},"meetingId":"0c779306cf48461e8680ca6deee2aa11","id":"181fbe84813a4fe1b8c015be3a76dd71"}],"name":"2022 ASCEND","location":"Las Vegas, NV","id":"0c779306cf48461e8680ca6deee2aa11","url":"https://www.ascend.events","startDate":"2022-10-24T05:00:00.0000000+00:00"}],"status":"CURATED","related":[],"downloads":[{"draft":false,"mimetype":"application/pdf","name":"Internal Layout of a Lunar Surface Habitat.pdf","type":"STI","links":{"original":"/api/citations/20220013669/downloads/Internal%20Layout%20of%20a%20Lunar%20Surface%20Habitat.pdf","pdf":"/api/citations/20220013669/downloads/Internal%20Layout%20of%20a%20Lunar%20Surface%20Habitat.pdf","fulltext":"/api/citations/20220013669/downloads/Internal%20Layout%20of%20a%20Lunar%20Surface%20Habitat.pdf.txt"}}],"downloadsAvailable":true,"index":"submissions-2026-11-12-06-24"}